{
  "name": "HL · FAQ workflow (4.1 Version A)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · FAQ workflow (Version A)\nLesson 4.1, Version A: the fixed workflow.\n\nChat Trigger → Text Classifier (one category per FAQ topic + Other) → a Google Sheets lookup of that topic's answer → reply. Other → \"I'll ask Tolu and get back to you.\"\n\n**Credentials:** OpenAI (chat model), Google Sheets OAuth2.\n**Replace:** YOUR_SHEET_ID in every Sheets node; YOUR_MODEL in the chat model.\n\nSheet tab **FAQ**, columns topic · answer. The topic values must match the category names exactly.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "e78022bc-c6ce-4ddc-a694-d4e65f314724",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "responseMode": "lastNode"
        }
      },
      "id": "04f7c54b-b427-4036-b20a-11e631f727e8",
      "name": "When chat message received",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputText": "={{ $json.chatInput }}",
        "categories": {
          "categories": [
            {
              "category": "opening hours",
              "description": "Questions about when Harvest Lane is open: days, times, weekends, public holidays such as Sallah or Christmas."
            },
            {
              "category": "delivery areas and days",
              "description": "Which areas of Ibadan we deliver to (Bodija, Akobo, Ring Road...) and on which days."
            },
            {
              "category": "delivery fee",
              "description": "How much delivery costs, and when it is free."
            },
            {
              "category": "payment",
              "description": "How customers can pay: transfer, card, pay on delivery, Paystack link."
            },
            {
              "category": "minimum order",
              "description": "Whether there is a minimum order value or quantity."
            },
            {
              "category": "how to order",
              "description": "How to place an order: WhatsApp, the Telegram order bot, cut-off times."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallback": "other"
        }
      },
      "id": "ca87f8e7-f054-4b0c-9ea4-ca648588c4c0",
      "name": "Classify FAQ topic",
